sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor TEK as Teknisi
  participant SPA as Aplikasi HP
  participant IDB as IndexedDB HP
  participant API as Server API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  TEK->>SPA: Tekan Kirim P2H tanpa sinyal
  SPA->>API: POST /api/p2h
  API--xSPA: jaringan putus<br/>atau 502, 503, 504
  SPA->>IDB: Simpan P2H, foto,<br/>tanda tangan ke antrean
  SPA-->>TEK: Tersimpan di HP
  Note over SPA,API: Environment: sinyal kembali,<br/>antrean diperiksa tiap 30 detik
  SPA->>IDB: Baca antrean
  SPA->>API: POST /api/p2h<br/>client_uuid yang sama
  API->>DB: Cari client_uuid
  alt belum ada
    API->>DB: Simpan P2H baru
    API-->>SPA: 201
  else sudah ada
    API-->>SPA: 200 duplicate true
  end
  SPA->>IDB: Hapus dari antrean
